  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening waste pickers&#x2019; role in the waste management value chain and society.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supports Kenya&#x2019;s circular economy goals by recognizing and strengthening the position of informal waste pickers, who face risks under the new waste laws. A socio-economic study conducted by the SSC circular economic highlights the need for targeted support to waste pickers</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Objective is strengthening waste pickers&#x2019; role in the waste management value chain and society. This will be done through; Improved organisational capacity of waste picker CBOs to champion the inclusion of waste pickers in the formal waste management system and society; and Improved individual capacity and resilience of waste pickers who will complete vocational training and thereby diversify their income.</narrative>
  </description>
